   "marker": "1.",
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "User clicks 'Clear': reset all criteria and the list Search box, show all documents within the user data scope.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Key-in on list 'Search' filters immediately. Click a sortable header to sort; click again to reverse.",
