  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "User clicks 'PO Number': open 'Detail PO for #<No>' modal with the route detail (10 rows per page, sortable by Route, searchable) and the totals footer: '% Sharing Percentage for <Code>', 'Total QTY', 'Total. Price'.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Route Percentage = route Qty Total / document Total Qty (TBD, OP-09). Price Total = Qty 20 x Price 20 + Qty 40 x Price 40.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Approval History lists every action on the document, latest first.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "d.",
   "text": "User clicks 'Download' icon: download CSV '<PO Number>.csv' with header data, every route and a TOTAL row (format TBD, OP-10).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.4 PO Status",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "PO Status",
     "width": 14
    },
    {
     "title": "Condition",
     "width": 32
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "Pending",
     "Created when PR is approved by DH; deadline = PO date + Day + 1 (System Master)"
    ],
    [
     "Approved",
     "Approved manually by General Affair before the deadline"
    ],
    [
     "Auto Approved",
     "Deadline passed; set by the scheduled job (Approved By = SYSTEM)"
    ],
    [
     "Rejected",
     "Rejected by General Affair with Reason; PR returned to PR Creation"
    ]
   ],
   "level": 2,
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "column_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.5 Approve / Reject Operation",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Rows can be ticked only when the login user is General Affair and the PO is Pending and before its deadline.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Approve (submit): set PO Approved, Approved By = login user, Approved Date = system date; insert Approval History.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Reject (submit): Reason mandatory (min 10 characters). Set PO Rejected with Reason. The PR goes back to the state it had right after PR Creation: PR Status = Returned, all levels cleared to '-', resubmit required from PR Creation. Insert Approval History on PO and PR.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "d.",
   "text": "If no PO is ticked, display message no. 4. Reason blank / too short: message no. 5 / 6. Not General Affair: no. 7. PO not Pending: no. 8. Deadline passed: no. 9 (the job will auto approve). Concurrency: no. 10. Success: no. 11.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.6 Auto Approve",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "A scheduled job (frequency TBD, OP-03) sets every Pending PO with system date >= Auto Approve At to Auto Approved, Approved By = SYSTEM.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "IP Admin can run the job immediately with 'Jalankan Auto Approve sekarang'; result in message no. 12.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Day + 1 is calculated as PO date + 24 hours (TBD, OP-01).",
   "level": 2
  }
